DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T171500
DTSTAMP:20260725T064035Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901301321364-52901301322391@local-events
DESCRIPTION:When the future is unscripted\, your greatest human skill is t
 he ability to think on your feet.\n\nAI technology may be able to process 
 data and draft content – but it cannot provide the presence of mind requ
 ired to authentically build trust\, pivot to the needs of the moment\, tap
  into imagination\, or find a creative path forward when there is no map. 
 These fundamentally human skills can be cultivated and enhanced through th
 e art of improvisation.\n\nJoin us for an interactive three-part online se
 ries\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/classes
 /register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=12527
